To cut down that tree, it took a saw.

209
00:40:57,832 --> 00:40:59,612
To make the saw, it took steel.

210
00:40:59,932 --> 00:41:01,972
To make the steel, it took iron ore.

211
00:41:03,292 --> 00:41:09,012
This black center, we call it lead, but it's really graphite, compressed graphite.

212
00:41:35,188 --> 00:41:41,788
Orada, yellow paint, orada, paint that made the black lines, orada, glue that holds it together.

213
00:41:42,728 --> 00:41:46,627
Literally thousands of people cooperated to make this pencil.

214
00:41:47,148 --> 00:41:54,627
People who don't speak the same language, who practice different religions, who might hate one another if they ever met.

215
00:41:55,627 --> 00:42:02,688
When you go down to the store and buy this pencil, you are in effect trading a few minutes of your time.

216
00:42:03,251 --> 00:42:05,251
Bir saniyede,

217
00:42:05,251 --> 00:42:07,251
bu kadar da bir saniyede,

218
